The generated catalog is sorted by case-insensitive display name, then system
and canonical ID, for deterministic zero-work menu browsing. Lookup remains
allocation-free, and the default is base16-default-dark. The importer accepts
the pinned download, a local gallery.js, or extracted SCHEMES JSON; it validates
the pinned payload identity, every entry and resolved color, control-free
metadata, unique IDs, complete palettes, variants, counts, and default before
writing output.
